    "body": "Ha... I proposed something similar for Firefox in the past, but wasn't accepted...\r\n\r\nBut yeah, if it becomes a time-based model, it's probably dangerous to allow it go across the frame boundary automatically, but is it possible to have `postMessage` carry the activation when going across the boundary? I suppose it wouldn't be as bad in that case.",
